id=b1051c-eink-compat
name=Bigme B1051C Pro E Ink compat (HWC shim + xrz props)
version=0.1.7
versionCode=8
author=matanmi12 + port of awong-dev/hibreak-pro-color hwcshim
description=HWC shim (RGBA client-target commit fix, Bigme colour pipeline: vivid/contrast/brightness + stock LUTs via vendor.xrz.global_*), xrz props, lcd_density 300, stock touch/pen IDC (ORIENTATION_270), SF boot watchdog, HW overlays kept off (SF 1008, re-checked every 10 s), guard for the vendor processImage crash, einkd (check_commit on touch) + shim GC16 every N page turns (clean_frequency), phh-su stub so Magisk late stages run, RRO: no fade-to-black before sleep. Disable: touch /data/adb/modules/b1051c-eink-compat/disable
